   "summary": "This special report prepared by the Civil Information and Education Section of GHQ SCAP compiles comprehensive statistics and institutional rosters for schools in Aomori Prefecture for April and November 1946. Prepared in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education, it addresses historical gaps in educational record-keeping prior to the postwar 6-3-3-4 system reorganization. The document provides summary distribution tables by level and administrative jurisdiction, followed by detailed rosters listing school names, locations, founding dates, student enrollments, and teacher headcounts for national, prefectural, municipal, and town/village institutions.",
